    "crop": "Anatomical .55 scale at shared vanishing point places frame y171.36..372.45, silhouette cut wrist edge y361. Source right grip y340 renders at303.",
    "limitation": "Historical active illustrations cannot keep receivers continuous while both physical axes meet centered aim. Runtime now reuses accepted idle source with uniform continuous 0..2.2% recoil about fixed vanishing point; original phase source pixels and metadata preserved. Runtime dual flash binding belongs to coordinator."
  },
